# Deferred, link state

- Dashed Editor chips have no accessible description. Chat chips carry
  `aria-description` in the follow's own words ("No document at that
  address"). In the Editor the state lives on the
  decoration spans (`link-resolution-decorations.ts`) inside the link mark's
  `<a>`, and a description on a generic span is not announced, so a screen
  reader hears an ordinary link until it is followed. Carry the description on
  the `<a>` (for example a link mark view reading the surface's resolution),
  still adding nothing to the schema, the shared document, or the clipboard.
